# Come home from orbit, with Pathfinder (or anything with
# its upper stage, then the capsule, then a parachute).
#
# First plan a "Come down" burn on the map (M, Maneuver,
# Suggested), then upload this.

log Deorbit burn
burn

# Drop the upper stage; the capsule's heat shield first.
wait 10 s
stage
sas retrograde

# Arm the parachute (it opens itself when slow enough).
wait 5 s
stage

wait until altitude < 100 km
log Entry
wait until landed
log Home
